[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="HiringBench" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(430, -150)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the hiring bench"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The hiring bench[/b]

A long bench against the wall, its seat polished by years of waiting. Before dawn the gang-masters sit here with their ale and pick their crews for the day, and the men who are not picked drink here after.

Someone has carved a row of small marks along the edge, one for every morning they were passed over."
reexamine_text = "The marks along the bench edge go on and on."

