[node name="RiverBoard" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-300, -150)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the board by the hearth"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The board by the hearth[/b]

Names chalked on a black board, a few at a time, and wiped away when the river gives the body back. Three names have stayed a long while.

The dockhands touch the board on their way out at night. Nobody says why."
reexamine_text = "Three names, still on the board."

